$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{4}{1+2{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =4\\int \\frac{1}{1+(\\sqrt{2}x)^{2}}\\text{d}x \\\\  & =4\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{\\sqrt{2}}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u \\\\  & =\\frac{4\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =2\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14081876/state.json" "file_sha256" "e7bbb47845a2e23b35f5040b32279d278f6ed5a78c9f14e4c24c773a7367c5df"} {"question" "q-114040" "field" nil "attribute" "question/difficulty" "value" :question.difficulty/easy "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14081876/activity-metadata.json" "file_sha256" "7d6962be85cd3228234bebdeaf5b79a516623b560a0cec1cb2afbcf673404b4f"} {"question" "q-114040" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/type" "value" :answer-field.type/radio "category" "ma_widget" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14081876/state.json" "file_sha256" "e7bbb47845a2e23b35f5040b32279d278f6ed5a78c9f14e4c24c773a7367c5df"} {"question" "q-114040" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/choices" "value" [["math" "2\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C"] ["math" "2\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(2x)+C"] ["math" "2\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C"] ["math" "4\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C"] ["math" "\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C"]] "category" "ma_complete_choices" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14081876/state.json" "file_sha256" "e7bbb47845a2e23b35f5040b32279d278f6ed5a78c9f14e4c24c773a7367c5df"} {"question" "q-114040" "field" "selection" "attribute" "answer-field/correct" "value" [:answer.type/math "2\\sqrt{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\sqrt{2}x)+C"] "category" "ma_successful_grade" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14081876/state.json" "file_sha256" "e7bbb47845a2e23b35f5040b32279d278f6ed5a78c9f14e4c24c773a7367c5df"} {"question" "q-73714" "field" nil "attribute" "question/problem" "value" "$\\int \\frac{3}{36+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x=$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14081876/state.json" "file_sha256" "e7bbb47845a2e23b35f5040b32279d278f6ed5a78c9f14e4c24c773a7367c5df"} {"question" "q-73714" "field" nil "attribute" "question/worked-solution" "value" "Let's rewrite our integral as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{36+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\int \\frac{3}{36\\cdot (1+{x}^{2}/36)}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{x}^{2}/36}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(x/6)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis integral resembles the basic integral for inverse tangent\n\n$$\n\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\text{d}u=\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C.\n$$\n\nThe only difference is that instead of ${u}^{2}$ as the variable, we have ${(\\frac{x}{6})}^{2}.$\n\nSo, let's substitute $u=\\frac{x}{6}.$ Differentiating, we get\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}u}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{6}\\,⟹\\,\\text{d}x=6\\,\\text{d}u.\n$$\n\nUsing the above, we can write the integral in terms of $u$ and evaluate:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\begin{aligned}\\int \\frac{3}{36+{x}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x & =\\frac{1}{12}\\int \\frac{1}{1+(x/6)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{12}\\int \\frac{1}{1+{u}^{2}}\\cdot (6\\,\\text{d}u) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\int \\frac{\\text{d}u}{1+{u}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡u+C \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{arctan}⁡(\\frac{x}{6})+C\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" "category" "ma_capture" "file" "/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14081876/state.json" "file_sha256" "e7bbb47845a2e23b35f5